        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Bagram was extremely costly, amounting to billions of dollars.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The U.S. should not have abandoned Bagram after spending billions on it.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
